{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "3892ee396ec6acb4baf887eb9560a5994cee4086326e1dbaad9dbeca62099a09", "ja": "ねえねえ、兄ちゃん！\nこないだのお仕事って、チョー楽しかったよね♪", "zh": "欸欸，大哥哥！\n前阵子的工作，超开心对不对♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d92047a3d496732ab692ed1db4401e9a31990ea9f40b1f5ae3a70018d40b77c1", "ja": "こないだのって言うと……\n亜美達が小さくなったってやつか？", "zh": "你说前阵子……\n是指亚美你们变小的那次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "21f46b01eef7772b9b1717d1b0d69c5ea52708a33dd31c354fc95951a159e18b", "ja": "そうそう、それ！　せっかくだから、\nしばらく小っちゃいままでよかったんだけどな～。", "zh": "对对，就是那次！难得有这种机会，\n要是变小的时间再久一点就好了的说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1003_011ami", "source_sha256": "96368b60bc1b50bdc522e7acd8f9b45dd143f051f75f1d8ad17baa35c65a82cf", "ja": "ひまわりの種はおいしかったしー、\nカラカラを回すのも楽しかったしー！", "zh": "而且向日葵种子很好吃～\n转动滚轮也很好玩～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "8f5ed54074ea5c291d42cf72e39e4409d81a7fbb31f9a6a0128ea2ff07529a1f", "ja": "好きなトコに忍びこめるし、イタズラもはかどるし、\n兄ちゃんのヒミツも握れるし♪　んっふっふ～♪", "zh": "可以躲进任何一个地方，恶作剧也很方便，\n还能知道大哥哥的小秘密♪嗯哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f7f42cfc5f4f5622770f227ae1ac6a7e1a5a42fa1188807f6cd9ac7d8bbf6d73", "ja": "だんだん不穏なことに……。言っておくけど、そもそも\n亜美に握られて困るようなヒミツはないからな！", "zh": "越听越让人不安了……我可先说清楚，\n我才没有不方便被亚美知道的小秘密喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1006_011ami", "source_sha256": "3c85622d668cb667cdd30224586e78866a9f96d54ed92d705c6c578af79e0635", "ja": "おお、さっすが兄ちゃん、男前だよー！\nよっ、このイケメン！", "zh": "哦哦，真不愧是大哥哥，有男子气概～！\n酷喔，这位帅哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "97015c8e99ae70315d369c7a536eddbe55bda47bc637ba7f913dd3787e18f52e", "ja": "んじゃ、さっき拾ったイケメン兄ちゃんの手帳、\nみんなで読んでくんね！　バイキュー♪", "zh": "那么，刚才捡到的帅气大哥哥的手帐，\n亚美就去找大家一起打开来看了！掰谢啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0062_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0062_1008_p", "source_sha256": "19ee9a928c8b676cc494ec55b19a251511bc56c221a426c551f2b3dc789d3180", "ja": "え？　……あれ、いつの間に！？\n亜美、ちょっと待て！　亜美ー！", "zh": "咦？……奇怪，什么时候！？\n亚美，等一下！亚美──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
